## 10. TEST DATA MANAGEMENT

### 10.1 Test Data Strategy

**Production-Like Test Data:**
```
Test Database Size: 10% of production
├─ 1,000 test firms
├─ 10,000 test clients
├─ 50,000 test accounts
├─ 500,000 test positions
├─ 2,000,000 test transactions

Test Data Refresh: Weekly from production (anonymized)
Anonymization:
  - Replace real names with fake names
  - Replace real emails with test@example.com
  - Replace SSN with test values
  - Keep data relationships intact
```

